        <a href="/community" class="text-opacity-40 text-white hover:underline">Sharing Stacks</a>
        <a href="https://docs.vanillaos.org/apx/en/working-w-stacks" class="text-opacity-40 text-white hover:underline">Creating Stacks</a>
